From 2d8693c86e28d7578a95ddc6ef85bee4a1d375a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BearddOddity <beardedoddity@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:49:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] Mod API: drawFx hands modules a read-only world probe;
 guide trail routes round walls over the floor; waypoint stands over the floor
 of the spot

The shared magic engine's collider (raycast, and now heightAt on the world and exterior wrappers) is offered to modules as
floor(x, y, z) and ray(origin, dir, max). The guide trail plans a one-metre-grid A* over it (floor continuity, waist and
body-width rays), string-pulls and lays the embers on the floor; the waypoint's diamond is projected from the quest's own spot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
